<http://purl.org/spar/mito/implicit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/spar/mito/> .
<http://purl.org/spar/mito/implicit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\nA type of mention according to which something is suggested or understood through context rather than named directly within a text.\n    "@en .
